  "uncertain": [
    "Image 1 prints 'G21 RGB STATUS' immediately left of the 39 pad label; read as an annotation for the RGB LED on G21 (image 2's table lists G21 RGB), not a function of pin 39, but the placement leaves it open.",
    "Image 2 bottom row ordering: started at the left (USB ends tie); image 1's numbered backside list runs 1=5V ... 12=G37/CS, the reverse of image 2's left-to-right order, so the physical start end of this port is open."
  ],
  "notes": "Image 1 is the module label artwork: circled numbers are GPIO numbers recorded as labels where no GPIO name is printed ('GPIO' + circle recorded as GPIO11/GPIO12/GPIO14/GPIO0). Short notes beside pins (GP, U0 Tx, MMS, MDI, MDO, U0Rx, RST, SDA, SCL) recorded as functions as printed; GND bottom-right is a pin. USB D-:G19/D+:G20 and BTN 0 are notes, not pins. Image 2: labels G1..G46 with ADC (A1CHn/A2CHn), touch, clock-out, JTAG, UART and I2C names read outward."
